## Use in a technology profile

The determined domain can link a technology that serves integrations between these two
deployment models:

```terraform
resource "sapintegrationsuite_integration_assessment_technology_domain" "acme_esb" {
  technology_id = sapintegrationsuite_integration_assessment_technology.acme_esb.id
  domain_id     = data.sapintegrationsuite_integration_assessment_domain_determination.selected.domain_id
}
```

